# Web UI patterns

- Prefer existing folders: `components/layout`, `components/listing`, `components/overlays`, `hooks`, `lib`.
- Use `@play/shared` types; extend fixture + shared types together when adding fields.
- Styling: Tailwind utilities + tokens in `index.css` (`rausch`, `line`, `grey100`, etc.).
- Icons: Lucide only unless matching reference requires custom SVG (e.g. guest favourite laurel).
- Modals: `role="dialog"`, `aria-modal="true"`, focus trap hook, close on Escape from a single owner when tied to history.
